CORE
dynamic_initialization.cpp
--cpp11 --validate-goto-model
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ global: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ static local: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A class constructed only during dynamic initialization (a global, and a
block-scope static reached from a global's initializer) keeps its virtual
table.
